@comment Each file and symlink the package installs, from dist/. They
@comment belong to root:wheel, with the mode set here.
@mode 0644
/usr/local/etc/claude-code/managed-settings.d/eat.json
/usr/local/etc/claude-code/managed-settings.d/prefs.json
/usr/local/etc/gitconfig
@comment Claude Code reads its managed settings only from
@comment /etc/claude-code, so point that at them.
/etc/claude-code
@comment The settings' directories, which pkg removes once they are
@comment empty. @mode does not suit them, so they set their own.
@dir(root,wheel,0755) /usr/local/etc/claude-code/managed-settings.d
@dir(root,wheel,0755) /usr/local/etc/claude-code
